THIRD-PARTY LIBRARIES BUNDLED OR LINKED IN RELEASE BUILDS

The following third-party components are compiled into, dynamically
linked against, or bundled inside Release builds of WaveEdit. Each is
listed with its license, copyright, and upstream URL. Full license
texts are in the JUCE/ submodule and (where applicable) alongside the
bundled binary.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
LAME MP3 Encoder
- Used for: MP3 export
- License: LGPL-2.0-or-later (full text: ThirdPartyLicenses/LAME-COPYING.txt)
- Copyright: © 1998-2017 The LAME Project
- Homepage: https://lame.sourceforge.io/
- How we ship it: macOS builds compile LAME 3.100 from the upstream source
  tarball (hash-pinned in cmake/ThirdPartyAudioLibs.cmake) and link it
  statically. Windows and Linux Release builds bundle the LAME shared
  library next to the executable.
- LGPL note: WaveEdit's complete source, including the build scripts that
  fetch and compile LAME, is available under the GPL, so users can rebuild
  WaveEdit against a modified LAME. LAME source: upstream URL above.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
